2026-09-25T00:00:03Z (RFD66606-2259) 'A coding session names branches, commits RFDs, spends its budget and parks work one way.
 # tags: rfd:hook
 Text:RFD2259  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-09-25T00:00:04Z (RFD66606-2259) '`head/*` and bare branch names, RFDs spread over three commits, and a feature branch left checked out that `repo sync` rebased into conflict markers all happened in one session.
 # tags: rfd:intrigue
 Text:RFD2259  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-09-25T00:00:05Z (RFD66606-2259) 'Read RFD66606-2258 next, the gates each pushed branch runs.
 # tags: rfd:exit
 Text:RFD2259  1 LINE
